  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 64 plugins and 244 official stars, with 517,999 weekly npm downloads; dsh-market led growth at +48 stars as the official repo shipped 0.2.0-rc.2. However, 12,907 of 16,849 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days, leaving the health score at 44 — watch activity, not raw counts.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时新增 <b>64</b> 个插件，官方仓库星标净增 <b>244</b>，npm 周下载量 <b>517999</b>；增长榜由 dsh-market 以 <b>48</b> 星领跑，官方同时放出 0.2.0-rc.2。不过 <b>16849</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>12907</b> 个已 7 天无更新，生态健康分仅 <b>44</b>，建议持续观察活跃度而非总量。"
